      "content": "thanks! that looks pretty good and professional. i just ran it through the simulator real quick and it gave me a score of 3. \n\nhonestly, that's a bit low for this module and i'm worried i won't pass if my scores stay in the single digits. i know i said don't go overboard, but could you try another version that's a bit more... impactful? maybe try to get the score up to at least a 10 or 12? just try to make it sound really strong and high-end without making it look like a total joke.",
